<title>UK: Benfield offer details due shortly-sources.</title>
<headline>Benfield offer details due shortly-sources.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Benfield &amp; Rea Investment Trust (BRIT) is expected very shortly to issue its official offer document for HCG Lloyd's Investment Trust, one of the trusts set up three years ago to invest in Lloyds of London, market sources said on Thursday.</p>
<p>No other offers are expected to emerge for HCG, which was due to merge with Lloyd's investment fund CLM until Benfield topped the 72 million stg merger deal with a 78 million stg bid, the sources said.</p>
<p>CLM last week extended its offer for HCG until  September 5.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Insurance News 44 171 542 2769</p>
</text>
